@@ -299,6 +309,14 @@ When an agent chat is selected in command mode, `/` focuses the chat, seeds the
 `/`, and enters insert mode so `/status`-style input submits through the same selected-agent chat
 path.
 
+Clean-review completion prompts are represented as transcript lines rather than as separate session
+DTO fields. `TerminalApp` and `RemoteTerminalApp` detect `FEATURE_DONE_PROMPT`, set the terminal
+completion prompt state in `TerminalUi`, show hidden chats that receive the prompt, and route `yes`
+or `no` answers through `WorkLeafController::answer_feature_done` or
+`HttpControllerClient::answer_feature_done`. A `yes` answer hides the completed patch-agent chat and
+returns focus to the command surface; a `no` answer clears the prompt and leaves the chat available
+for follow-up.
+
 The terminal app maps a session to a left-pane `READY` marker when the controller exposes no loading
 state for that session. `TerminalUi` queues one terminal bell when a chat transitions into the ready
 state and renders ready rows in reverse video so they remain highlighted until the chat becomes busy
